            "popup_stat": "−16.9%",
            "popup_stat_text": "fat mass (42.8% → 36.6% of body weight, p = 0.007) — while lean mass increased 7.1% (p = 0.015)*⁴",
            "popup_info_text": "The only group to meaningfully gain lean mass while losing fat. Muscle is metabolically active tissue — keeping it makes weight loss easier to sustain."
          }
        },
        "card_3": {
          "type": "score_card",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Diet + 40:1 blend",
            "subtitle": "Group 3 (n = 12)",
