            "caption": "fat-mass reduction — 35% more than diet alone — with lean mass preserved*⁴",
            "button_label": "See the numbers",
            "popup_heading": "Diet + Myo & D-Chiro (40:1)",
            "popup_stat": "−18.9%",
            "popup_stat_text": "fat mass (39% → 32.8% of body weight, p = 0.008) — the largest fat loss of the three groups, with lean mass preserved (+0.2%, p = 0.032)*⁴",
            "popup_info_text": "Every woman in this group also regained menstrual regularity by 6 months — the clearest sign the change was metabolic, not just caloric."
          }
        }
